      "data": {
        "text": "**Implementing Event Publishing**\n\nI've made progress! Having finalized `messaging_models.py` and `messaging_client.py`, I'm ready to move on to implementing `publish_event.py`. The focus will be on leveraging Google Cloud Pub/Sub for this event publishing module.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789829531595,
          "start": 1789829531547
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0ba27479b0010xqR1RI4K6lpo6",
      "message_id": "msg_0ba273fa5001kLFs4JxvQ4U3hk",
      "session_id": "ses_f45d8d846ffe8yiIqBJj5VhHBI",
