      "data": {
        "text": "**Implementing Event Consumption**\n\nI'm now focused on building the `consume_event.py` script. My goal is to get this consuming messages efficiently from the Cloud Pub/Sub subscription. The script needs to be robust and handle potential errors gracefully.\n\n\n",
