        "text": "**Implementing Dead Lettering**\n\nI'm now putting `dead_letter.py` into action. The plan is to handle failed messages by sending them to a designated dead-letter topic on Google Cloud Pub/Sub. This way, nothing gets lost.\n\n\n",
