        "text": "**Implementing Batch Publishing**\n\nOkay, I'm now focusing on implementing `batch_publish.py`. The goal is to efficiently publish a group of messages with Google Cloud Pub/Sub. This should be interesting to code. I'm hoping to improve upon single publish functions this way.\n\n\n",
